# YOUR HOLDING IS WHERE YOU COME BACK TO (SETTLE.md S1; Outcomes.home_hearth).
# With a holding of your own and its hearth near, a lineman that takes hold and
# is not pulled free carries you off, and you wake beside your own fire, not at
# a rock face; the bag still lies where it took you.
#   tools/tour.sh tours/carried_home.tour --seed=1 --hour=11 --weather=clear:0 --give=knife:1,driftwood:6,stone:4 --held=knife --holding=hearth,lean_to
coast calm
zoom 8
walk 0,1 1.6
wait 0.6
spawn lineman
try 3
  walkto part 3
  tap swing
  await tell 8
end
await grip 6
await skipped 12
wait 0.6
shot 01-woken-by-your-own-fire with station:fire
